      "notes": "The Grok agent that drives a headful browser. Cloudflare Radar lists it as GrokAgent with a Web Bot Auth key directory on cursorusercontent.com (the cloud computers it runs on); the directory serves one Ed25519 key, and third parties report signing paused since early October 2026. It can route through the user's own connection, which defeats network checks. xAI publishes no bot page; shared static egress IPs are available from xAI on request. The separate Grok chat fetcher has no stable identifier: it rotates spoofed iPhone Safari, macOS Chrome, and Go-http-client user agents from datacenter and proxy networks such as M247 and Datacamp and is caught by behavior signals, not by this entry.",
